/ The chart grows into the free height of the page, so the page reaches
  the footer. The canvas lies above its box, so a smaller window can shrink
  the box again. The hidden dots give the bars the colors of the columns.
  The chart draws its title itself.
section.flex.flex-auto.flex-col.p-4.md:p-5.lg:p-0 class=CARD data-controller='car--comparison-chart--component' data-car--comparison-chart--component-currency-value=Currency.code data-car--comparison-chart--component-title-value=title
  - colors.each do |color|
    span.hidden class=color data-car--comparison-chart--component-target='swatch'
  script type='application/json' data-car--comparison-chart--component-target='data'
    == chart_data.to_json
  .relative.flex-auto.min-h-72.md:min-h-80
    .absolute.inset-0
      canvas.max-w-full data-car--comparison-chart--component-target='canvas'
